# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BANDS: (div, key, name, gloss, opts). Order within a division = activation order (older first).
# opts: w weight (default 1) · start/end (forced dates) · into (parent key: offshoots bud from it,
# merged bands fold into it) · kind 'band'|'village'|'following' · chief1856 (Hayden) ·
# track [(year,(lat,lon),note)] · at (fixed site for villages) · note · aka
